@gw = http://localhost:8080
# Jeton : scripts/token.sh <e-mail> (15 min)
@token = COLLER_LE_JETON_ICI

### Mes notifications non lues
GET {{gw}}/api/notifications?lue=false&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compteur
GET {{gw}}/api/notifications/non-lues/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marquer comme lue
PATCH {{gw}}/api/notifications/REMPLACER_ID/lue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tout lire (204)
POST {{gw}}/api/notifications/tout-lire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Flux SSE (ping toutes les 25 s ; à tester plutôt avec curl -N)
GET {{gw}}/api/notifications/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream
